{{wikibooks|Programming:C plus plus}}

===Etymology===
From the name of the [[C]] language (on which it was based) and [[++]], the [[increment]] [[operator]] in both languages, suggesting something added to C.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{lb|en|computer language}} A [[multi-|multi]]-[[paradigm]] [[high-level]] [[compiler|compiled]] [[programming language]], that is a more advanced form of [[C]].

